// Pharos: custom keyboard shortcuts.
//
// Only bindings that COSMIC's defaults leave free. Checked against
// cosmic-settings' shipped `defaults` — Super+space, Super+a..b, f, g, h..m,
// o, q, r, s, t, u..y and the digits are already taken, and silently stealing
// one of those would break a documented COSMIC shortcut.
//
// The launcher is not bound here. Redirecting `Launcher` in `system_actions`
// already points COSMIC's existing Super+space at jump, which is better than
// a second binding competing with the first.
//
// Action variants: System(..) and Spawn(String), per
// cosmic-settings-daemon/config/src/shortcuts/action.rs.
{
    // The PIM suite. Super+Shift, because the plain-Super letters are spoken
    // for and applications should not outrank window management.
    (modifiers: [Super, Shift], key: "m"): Spawn("envelope"),
    (modifiers: [Super, Shift], key: "c"): Spawn("circle"),
    (modifiers: [Super, Shift], key: "s"): Spawn("slate"),

    // Secrets.
    (modifiers: [Super, Shift], key: "v"): Spawn("locket"),

    // Home folder. Super+e is free and this is what every other desktop does.
    (modifiers: [Super], key: "e"): System(HomeFolder),
}
